WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.169 --> 00:00:02.290
Hi, everyone.

2
00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:04.530
Welcome to Introduction to Unreal Motion Graphics

3
00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:06.809
in Unreal Engine 5 for Programmers.

4
00:00:06.809 --> 00:00:09.390
In this talk, we're gonna look at the following topics.

5
00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:12.599
We're gonna look at UWidget and the user widget.

6
00:00:12.599 --> 00:00:14.519
We're gonna look at the widget blueprint editor

7
00:00:14.519 --> 00:00:16.739
and widget animations.

8
00:00:16.739 --> 00:00:17.579
From there, we're gonna look

9
00:00:17.579 --> 00:00:19.140
at widget overrideable functions

10
00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.019
and some special UProperties specifies

11
00:00:21.019 --> 00:00:22.870
that we have available.

12
00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:23.850
From there, we're gonna take a look

13
00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:24.789
at the widget component

14
00:00:24.789 --> 00:00:26.769
and the widget interaction component.

15
00:00:26.769 --> 00:00:29.129
Finally, we'll wrap up by looking at a live example

16
00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:30.929
of a UI element created in UMG

17
00:00:30.969 --> 00:00:32.729
that's built on top of our previous example

18
00:00:32.729 --> 00:00:34.170
from the gameplay talk

19
00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:35.789
and it will implement a lot of the principles

20
00:00:35.789 --> 00:00:38.289
that we introduce in the following presentation.
